    <published>2020-12-17T09:45:52.000Z</published>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3><p>Plugins</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="betterzipql"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#betterzipql"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://macitbetter.com/downloads/" rel="noopener noreferrer">BetterZipQL</a></h3><blockquote>
<p>Preview archives</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Note: The BetterZipQL plugin was integrated with the BetterZip app.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Run <code>brew install betterzip</code> to install the BetterZip app and its Quick Look plugin or <a href="https://macitbetter.com/BetterZip.zip" rel="noopener noreferrer">download manually</a></p>
<p>The legacy BetterZipQL plugin can be <a href="https://macitbetter.com/dl/BetterZipQL-1.5.zip" rel="noopener noreferrer">downloaded here</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://macitbetter.com/BetterZip-Quick-Look-Generator/" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://github.com/sindresorhus/quick-look-plugins/raw/main/screenshots/BetterZipQL.png" alt /></a></p>

