    <title>Quick Look Plugins Updates on Jan 21, 2020</title>
    <updated>2020-01-21T10:40:42.000Z</updated>
    <published>2020-01-21T10:40:42.000Z</published>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3><p>Install</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="using-homebrew"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#using-homebrew"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Using <a href="https://brew.sh" rel="noopener noreferrer">Homebrew</a></h3><ul>
<li>Run <code>brew install &lt;package&gt;</code></li>
</ul>
<h5 id="catalina-notes"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#catalina-notes"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Catalina notes</h5><p>To get many plugins working in Catalina and later, you will need to remove the quarantine attribute.</p>
<p>Run this to see the attributes:</p>
<pre><code>xattr -r ~/Library/QuickLook</code></pre><p>And run this to remove the attributes:</p>
<pre><code>xattr -d -r com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/QuickLook</code></pre>]]></content>
